<ResourceDictionary xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui"
                    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">
  <!--
    icsmooi brand marks.

    Wordmark ("twin-engine oo"): lowercase "icsmooi" in very round, heavy, monoline letters —
    stroke-only centrelines drawn with a thick round-capped pen (same technique as Icons.axaml,
    so there is no font dependency). The letters use Icsmooi.Text; the two "o"s use
    Icsmooi.Accent (afterburner orange): a double "o" reads as twin jet engines / force dials.

    Grid (logo units, canvas ~112 x 29): stroke 4.5, x-height (centreline) 13 from y=12 to y=25.
    Dots are a separate, slightly heavier stroke (5.5). Thick strokes eat counters, so the letters
    are widened rather than thinned: the 's' bowls (r 3.25) leave ~2-unit slits and the 'm' stems
    are 9 apart (4.5 counters) — retune here if you change the stroke.

    Spacing is OPTICAL, not geometric. Equal bounding-box gaps look uneven because letter shapes
    differ: an open 'c', or a round 'o' facing another round 'o', reads far looser than a straight
    stem next to a curve. Each pair was measured as the mean horizontal space between the two
    silhouettes over the x-height band (profile depth capped at 25% of x-height), and the letters
    were shifted so every pair has the same ~5.25-unit optical gap. The nominal box-to-box gaps
    therefore differ on purpose: i-c 3.5, c-s 0.5 (the c's box assumes a full circle but its right
    side is open), s-m 3.3, m-o 3.0, o-o 2.2, o-i 3.4. The o-o pair is opened ~0.3 beyond the
    measured value because two facing circles are judged by their closest points, not their mean
    gap. If you retune a letter, redo the measurement for the pairs touching it
    (method above) rather than nudging by eye.

    Monogram: dark disc + orange ring + light 'i' stem + orange dot on a 64 x 64 grid. The app
    icon (Assets/icsmooi.ico) is generated from the same primitives by tools/GenerateAppIcon.ps1 —
    keep the two in sync.

    Usage:
      <ContentControl Theme="{StaticResource Icsmooi.Wordmark}" Height="22" />
      <ContentControl Theme="{StaticResource Icsmooi.Monogram}" Height="32" />
  -->

  <ControlTheme x:Key="Icsmooi.Wordmark" TargetType="ContentControl">
    <Setter Property="Height" Value="24" />
    <Setter Property="IsHitTestVisible" Value="False" />
    <Setter Property="Focusable" Value="False" />
    <Setter Property="Template">
      <ControlTemplate>
        <Viewbox>
          <Canvas Width="112.78" Height="29">
            <!-- i -->
            <Path Data="M3.25 12 V25" Stroke="{DynamicResource Icsmooi.Text}" StrokeThickness="4.5" StrokeLineCap="Round" />
            <!-- c -->
            <Path Data="M22.69 14.32 A6.5 6.5 0 1 0 22.69 22.68" Stroke="{DynamicResource Icsmooi.Text}" StrokeThickness="4.5" StrokeLineCap="Round" />
            <!-- s -->
            <Path Data="M35.23 13.625 A3.25 3.25 0 1 0 32.41 18.5 A3.25 3.25 0 1 1 29.6 23.375" Stroke="{DynamicResource Icsmooi.Text}" StrokeThickness="4.5" StrokeLineCap="Round" StrokeJoin="Round" />
            <!-- m -->
            <Path Data="M43.5 25 V16.5 A4.5 4.5 0 0 1 52.5 16.5 V25 M52.5 16.5 A4.5 4.5 0 0 1 61.5 16.5 V25" Stroke="{DynamicResource Icsmooi.Text}" StrokeThickness="4.5" StrokeLineCap="Round" StrokeJoin="Round" />
            <!-- o o (twin engines, accent) -->
            <Path Data="M68.98 18.5 A6.5 6.5 0 1 1 81.98 18.5 A6.5 6.5 0 1 1 68.98 18.5 Z" Stroke="{DynamicResource Icsmooi.Accent}" StrokeThickness="4.5" />
            <Path Data="M88.64 18.5 A6.5 6.5 0 1 1 101.64 18.5 A6.5 6.5 0 1 1 88.64 18.5 Z" Stroke="{DynamicResource Icsmooi.Accent}" StrokeThickness="4.5" />
            <!-- i -->
            <Path Data="M109.53 12 V25" Stroke="{DynamicResource Icsmooi.Text}" StrokeThickness="4.5" StrokeLineCap="Round" />
            <!-- i dots -->
            <Path Data="M3.25 4.5 H3.26 M109.53 4.5 H109.54" Stroke="{DynamicResource Icsmooi.Text}" StrokeThickness="5.5" StrokeLineCap="Round" />
          </Canvas>
        </Viewbox>
      </ControlTemplate>
    </Setter>
  </ControlTheme>

  <ControlTheme x:Key="Icsmooi.Monogram" TargetType="ContentControl">
    <Setter Property="Height" Value="32" />
    <Setter Property="IsHitTestVisible" Value="False" />
    <Setter Property="Focusable" Value="False" />
    <Setter Property="Template">
      <ControlTemplate>
        <Viewbox>
          <Canvas Width="64" Height="64">
            <Ellipse Canvas.Left="2" Canvas.Top="2" Width="60" Height="60"
                     Fill="{DynamicResource Icsmooi.Background}"
                     Stroke="{DynamicResource Icsmooi.Accent}" StrokeThickness="4" />
            <Path Data="M32 30 V45" Stroke="{DynamicResource Icsmooi.Text}" StrokeThickness="9" StrokeLineCap="Round" />
            <Path Data="M32 17.5 H32.01" Stroke="{DynamicResource Icsmooi.Accent}" StrokeThickness="10" StrokeLineCap="Round" />
          </Canvas>
        </Viewbox>
      </ControlTemplate>
    </Setter>
  </ControlTheme>

</ResourceDictionary>
